m/banners/v4/episode/9684009/screencap/643ed8103e32b.jpg"},{"title":"Droplets of Love: Lettuce and the Little Mermaid","synopsis":"The Maritime Museum in Odaiba is opening a new exhibition today, and an item in it may contain Mew Aqua!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708871/screencap/6447d99450d1d.jpg"},{"title":"Music Video Madness: When Two Prodigies Clash!","synopsis":"Zakuro is producing her next music video! It’s Music Video Madness: When Two Prodigies Clash!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708872/screencap/64513e7744b73.jpg"},{"title":"His Hidden Resolve: The Birth of the Mew Project","synopsis":"Were Ichigo and Ryo kissing? Does it count if they were both cats?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708873/screencap/645219c22d65f.jpg"},{"title":"My Future Starts Now: This Is the Real Me","synopsis":"It’s been a while since Masaya and Ichigo have had time to themselves like this. What are they going to do?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708874/screencap/6464400ce3ed0.jpg"},{"title":"Kish and the Blue Knight","synopsis":"Ichigo’s arm is red after getting in a fight the night before. As a result, Kish has a plan.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708875/screencap/646d16fb483f7.jpg"},{"title":"Deep Blue","synopsis":"Tokyo is still encased in the dome of clouds, and the temperature inside is only growing hotter...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708876/screencap/6476750bf1a69.jpg"},{"title":"Scattered Hearts and a Tearful Night","synopsis":"Aoyama and the Blue Knight were both false identities their savior assumed. What’s the plan now?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708877/screencap/647f5cb98cefe.jpg"},{"title":"Hear Our Cry! The Final Battle!","synopsis":"It all comes down to this!  Will this be their last battle? And where on Earth is Ichigo?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708878/screencap/648897b0ac1ea.jpg"},{"title":"The Future We Build Together","synopsis":"Deep Blue will use Mew Aqua to amplify her power to its limit, creating a portal between the Earth and her planet!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9708879/screencap/649217a68e3d2.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
